			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> just linking the answer I gave on Bluesky (saw it there first) in case it interests anyone here: <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol/post/3m4jbj7pax22p\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">bsky.app/profile/sjoy.lol/post</span><span class=\"invisible\">/3m4jbj7pax22p</span></a></p>",
