			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T21:46:19.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> On a serious note, I agree about setting it at a system level. I do wonder if the common folk know about that though? Then again most of them are probably just running the system default anyway. Having the control on-site puts it in front of them.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
